{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/extras/EC_Gif_01.gif?t=1745370356\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare for the great harvest! Evil Crops is a roguelike-like dungeon crawler where you fight against an ensemble of corrupted vegetables in order to save your farm! Construct your own bespoke weapons, gather loots and upgrades, unlock new areas, and have yourself a field day with this game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/extras/EC_Gif_02.gif?t=1745370356\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout the procedurally-generated dungeons, you'll find enemies of various types and difficulties. From silly and mostly-harmless tomatoes to tricky and spicy pumpkins. Learn their different attacks, roll around and weed them off!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/extras/EC_Gif_03.gif?t=1745370356\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sometimes, you have to take matters into your own hands \u2013 and being a farmer is no walk in the park! Collect vegetable aspects and craft your own guns the way you like it: mix and match different aspects for a unique firing experience, or stick to a single plant to maximize its unique potential!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/extras/EC_Gif_04.gif?t=1745370356\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You reap what you sow, and with enough crops defeated you're bound to have a bounty! Clear an entire area and be rewarded with a unique item to help you along the game; or gather seed coins as you progress through the dungeons, then spend them wisely in the friendly not-so-scarecrow's shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/extras/EC_Gif_05.gif?t=1745370356\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is much to see beyond the fences! Unlock and explore brand new biomes after defeating each boss, and discover many new sinister vegetables \u2013 and their unique aspects!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3379640?t=1745370356","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3379640?t=1745370356","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/4135b8b2bb0df901defaaf63d2942574458e8c8a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745370356","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/4135b8b2bb0df901defaaf63d2942574458e8c8a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745370356","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/extras/EC_Gif_01.gif?t=1745370356\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare for the great harvest! Evil Crops is a roguelike-like dungeon crawler where you fight against an ensemble of corrupted vegetables in order to save your farm! Construct your own bespoke weapons, gather loots and upgrades, unlock new areas, and have yourself a field day with this game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/extras/EC_Gif_02.gif?t=1745370356\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout the procedurally-generated dungeons, you'll find enemies of various types and difficulties. From silly and mostly-harmless tomatoes to tricky and spicy pumpkins. Learn their different attacks, roll around and weed them off!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/extras/EC_Gif_03.gif?t=1745370356\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sometimes, you have to take matters into your own hands \u2013 and being a farmer is no walk in the park! Collect vegetable aspects and craft your own guns the way you like it: mix and match different aspects for a unique firing experience, or stick to a single plant to maximize its unique potential!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/extras/EC_Gif_04.gif?t=1745370356\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You reap what you sow, and with enough crops defeated you're bound to have a bounty! Clear an entire area and be rewarded with a unique item to help you along the game; or gather seed coins as you progress through the dungeons, then spend them wisely in the friendly not-so-scarecrow's shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/extras/EC_Gif_05.gif?t=1745370356\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is much to see beyond the fences! Unlock and explore brand new biomes after defeating each boss, and discover many new sinister vegetables \u2013 and their unique aspects!</p>","developers":["Gagonfe"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/header.jpg?t=1745370356","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257081881,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257081881/movie480.mp4?t=1744993809","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257081881/movie_max.mp4?t=1744993809"},"name":"Evil Crops Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257081881/94c11042e8da4b5e184136c0930fee57bf6a5546/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744993809","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257081881/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744993809","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257081881/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744993809"}}],"name":"Evil Crops","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E8400 or AMD Phenom II X2 550<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce 8800 GT, 512 MB or AMD Radeon HD 7570, 1 GB</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Gagonfe"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt\nAlkohol / Tabak","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/ss_02ace3e6fb84e589f7eb969bb5a3cbaef7f4bd8e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1745370356","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/ss_02ace3e6fb84e589f7eb969bb5a3cbaef7f4